      {
        "id": "model-derivative",
        "moduleId": "parameter-experiment",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "用导数验证峰值位置",
        "markdown": "对 $H(\\delta)$ 求导可以确认峰值位置：\n\n$$H'(\\delta)=\\log_2\\frac{1-\\delta}{\\delta}$$\n\n令导数为零得 $1-\\delta=\\delta$，即 $\\delta=0.5$；$\\delta<0.5$ 时导数为正，$\\delta>0.5$ 时导数为负，所以 $0.5$ 是唯一的极大值点。把 $\\delta=0.5$ 代回原式得到 $H=1$ bit/symbol，与曲线读数和教材结论一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-conclusions"
          ]
        }
      },
